<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96297" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταυρός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>upright pale</i> or
			<i>stake</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταυροὺς ἐκτὸς ἔλασσε διαμπερὲς ἔνθα
					καὶ ἔνθα πυκνοὺς καὶ θαμέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.453
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.2.21
			</span></i>; of <i>piles</i> driven in to serve as a foundation, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cross</i>, as the instrument of crucifixion, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				27.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.554a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸν ς. ἀπάγεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Peregr.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. λαμβάνειν, ἆραι,
			βαστάζειν</span>, metaph. of voluntary suffering, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				10.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				9.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.27
			</span></i>: its form was represented by the Greek letter T, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Jud.Voc.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>pale for impaling</i> a corpse, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
